error[R0610]: comparison with NaN is always false
--> 11:9: `==` against NaN is always false, whatever the value is
  = note: NaN is not equal to any value, itself included, so `==` against it never matches and `~=` always does
  = help: compare the value to itself, which is true only for NaN: `n ~= n`
          n ~= n

error[R0610]: comparison with NaN is always true
--> 16:9: `~=` against NaN is always true, whatever the value is
  = note: NaN is not equal to any value, itself included, so `==` against it never matches and `~=` always does
  = help: to test for NaN compare the value to itself: `v == v` is false only for NaN
